Addiction Connectome Preprocessed Initiative (ACPI), raw data
=============================================================

T1-weighted and resting-state fMRI from three INDI collections on
substance use:

* `du_1`: Duke University, nicotine (scans before and after smoking)
* `mta_1`: Multimodal Treatment of ADHD study, cannabis use
* `nyu_1`: NYU, nicotine dependence

Downloaded by brainspresso from s3://fcp-indi/data/Projects/ACPI/:
the per-site BIDS folders (`RawDataBIDS/<site>`) are merged.

* `participants.tsv` merges the site tables (column `site` added; `age`,
  `sex` and `handedness` harmonised). `du_1` has no BIDS participants
  table: its rows come from `PhenotypicData/du_1_phenotypic_data.csv`,
  decoded with `du_1_phenotypic_key.csv`.
* Site-level sidecars are copied to each subject folder.
* Sidecar values stored as text (`"3T"`, `"6:00"`, `"7/8"`) were
  converted to numbers, and slice timings from milliseconds to seconds.
* The original phenotypic tables are in `sourcedata/phenotype/`.
